msgctxt "124"
msgid ""
"So how much is it gonna cost to fix up the sheet metal on\r\n"
"that car?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid ""
"Well, it'll have to be buffed out from the inside, plus the\r\n"
"cost of a fresh new coat of paint... I figure it'll come to\r\n"
"about, oh, two million yen. Just a ballpark figure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "That's ridiculous."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid ""
"That's a high-end sports car you fucked up there, pal!\r\n"
"Didn't you hear!? The entire body's gonna have to be\r\n"
"redone just to make it look half decent!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid "You sure know an awful lot about car repairs, don't you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid ""
"Shut up! You should be happy we're willing to settle this\r\n"
"out of court for a measly two mil!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid ""
"Now, now... Two million yen is a fairly hefty sum, and\r\n"
"I imagine you can't pay it all right away..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid ""
"So how about this? For now, you can just sign an agreement\r\n"
"that says you'll pay for the car repairs, whatever their\r\n"
"final cost may be."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid ""
"And who knows? Maybe it'll end up being cheaper than we\r\n"
"thought, maybe even around ten thousand or so. What do you\r\n"
"say?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid "Sounds all right, I suppose. Here you go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid ""
"I'm so glad we could settle this in a rational manner. We'll\r\n"
"send you the bill when all the repairs have been made."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid "Please take that door on your way out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid "Are you kidding me? I'm not signing anything."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid ""
"I'm terribly sorry to hear that... but I'm afraid we can't\r\n"
"let you leave this office without signing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid ""
"After we're through with ya, you'll practically be beggin'\r\n"
"to sign that paper... whether in ink or in blood!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid "I'll sign and see what happens."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid "Nope. This is way too shady."
msgstr ""

